EMPT_DYNAMIC Wed, 26 Mar 2025 07:48:57 +0000 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV RENOIR) - AMD Ryzen 7 4800H with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nGenerating a custom compilation config from the editor using Project -> Tools -> Engine Compilation Configuration Editor... will write wrong names for some of the build options.\n\nDisabling \"3D Physics\" results in the following contents in the .build file (truncated to relevant parts):\n ```\n{\n    \"disabled_build_options\": {\n        ...\n        \"disable_3d_physics\": true,\n    }\n    ...\n}\n```\n\nBut in the main SConstruct file, the actual check expects the following string: `disable_physics_3d`. (Notice they are different :)). After a short inspection, there are some mismatched options.\n\n\n| SConstruct  | .build |\n| ------------- | ------------- |\n| disable_physics_2d | disable_2d_physics |\n| disable_physics_3d | disable_3d_physics |\n| disable_navigation_2d | disable_navigation | \n| disable_navigation_3d | disable_navigation`(?)` |\n| disable_xr | openxr |\n| N/A | rendering_device |\n| disable_advanced_gui | N/A |\n| minizip | N/A |\n\nEdit: Relevant files\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1f56d96cf2c768c3844c68ccb504dfeee841ae15/editor/editor_build_profile.cpp#L47\nand\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1f56d96cf2c768c3844c68ccb504dfeee841ae15/SConstruct#L987\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nGenerate a custom build configuration containing one the mentioned settings. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/fo